---
const hostCommands = [
  '<span class="tk-fn">curl</span> -fsSL https://herden.austrheim.ca7.fm/install.sh | sh',
  '<span class="tk-fn">herden</span> pair',
].join('\n');

const sourceCommands = [
  '<span class="tk-fn">git</span> clone https://github.com/3loc/herden.git',
  '<span class="tk-fn">cd</span> herden',
  '<span class="tk-comment"># after setting your Apple team and bundle IDs</span>',
  '<span class="tk-fn">make</span> install',
].join('\n');
---

<section id="build" class="section substrate-grid">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Get started</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Two commands on your Host.</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">Install the native runtime on Linux or macOS, then scan its QR code in the TestFlight app. The source remains available when you want to build and sign the iOS app yourself.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="code">
        <div class="card-bar">
          <span class="eyebrow">Install and pair</span>
          <span class="card-lang">bash</span>
        </div>
        <pre set:html={hostCommands}></pre>
      </article>

      <article class="code">
        <div class="card-bar">
          <span class="eyebrow">Build iOS from source</span>
          <span class="card-lang">bash</span>
        </div>
        <pre set:html={sourceCommands}></pre>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="detail">The <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/3loc/herden/blob/main/docs/guides/build-ios.md">complete build guide</a> lists the exact signing fields, explains device detection, and includes the focused and full test commands.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    margin-top: var(--sp-10);
  }

  .code {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--r-card);
    background: var(--surface-code);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 40px;
    padding: 0 var(--sp-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .card-lang {
    font: var(--type-mono-sm);
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-mono);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--sp-5);
    font: var(--type-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-mono);
    color: var(--syn-plain);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .detail {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
    font: var(--type-body-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
